   "skill": {
    "name": "feature-dev",
    "title": {
     "zh-CN": "功能开发流程",
     "en": "Feature development workflow"
    },
    "summary": {
     "zh-CN": "按七个阶段开发功能：读懂现有代码、提出澄清问题、比较实现方案、经你同意才实现、最后做质量审查。二次开发自 Anthropic 官方 Claude Code 插件 feature-dev：三个专家子代理改为随附的只读角色说明，审查范围补上已暂存改动与新文件，写入经宿主确认，不自行安装依赖、提交或推送，并要求无人值守的 AI 同事任务只交方案。",
     "en": "A seven-phase feature workflow: understand the code, ask clarifying questions, compare approaches, implement only after you approve, then review. Derived from Anthropic's Claude Code plugin feature-dev: the three subagents become read-only role files, the review covers staged changes and new files, writes go through host confirmation, it never installs, commits or pushes on its own, and unattended AI colleague tasks are told to deliver only the plan."
    }
   },
