       "en": "\"Launch 2-3 code-explorer / code-architect / 3 code-reviewer agents in parallel\" becomes exploration, design and review passes that follow the shipped `agents/*.md` role files: delegated in parallel to read-only subtasks when the host allows one-off delegation (such as subagent_task granted to an AI colleague), otherwise run in turn; no model tier is chosen."
