      "upstream": "anthropics/claude-plugins-official@fa59bc9037741ecfa131aa27938272605710d7b2:plugins/feature-dev/commands/feature-dev.md",
      "summary": {
       "zh-CN": "新增写入边界：建文件、改文件与改变工作区的命令经宿主确认；不在本技能内安装或升级依赖、提交、推送、开 PR 或改 Git 配置，需要时写出命令交给用户；无人值守的 AI 同事任务（或提出的问题没有人回答时）停在第四阶段，只读分析，交付探索结论、待确认问题、方案与建议，不实现；没有回答的问题不算批准。第一阶段新增第 0 步先判断用户能否回答，第五阶段写明批准须是用户在对话中明确说实现、无人值守时这一阶段不开始，第 3 步同步说明写入边界。",
       "en": "Adds the write boundary: creating or editing files and commands that change the workspace go through the host's confirmation; the skill never installs or upgrades dependencies, commits, pushes, opens pull requests or changes Git configuration, and names the command for the user instead; unattended AI colleague tasks (or questions that get no answer) stop after phase 4, read-only, with the findings, open questions, approaches and recommendation, without implementing; an unanswered question is not approval. Phase 1 gets a step 0 that first decides whether the user can answer, and phase 5 says approval means the user saying in the conversation to implement, so the phase never starts in an unattended task; step 3 repeats the write boundary."
      },
