     "en": "The team manifest and catalog share human-readable Teloa titles; attribution stays in the description. Family/version method names change only native identities and their references; execution bodies, raw references, licenses and existing versions are retained.",
     "zh-TW": "團隊清單與目錄共用 Teloa 易讀標題，來源保留在說明中；方法使用本團隊版本名稱，僅名稱及對應引用變更，執行正文、原始參考、授權及既有版本保留。"
